---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contacto | Hotel Ads - Consultoría Hotelera">
  <main>
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">Hablemos</span>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          ¿En qué puedo ayudarte?
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Estoy disponible para analizar la situación de tu hotel y buscar la mejor estrategia para aumentar tu venta directa.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pb-32 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          
          <a href="tel:+34950131911" class="group p-10 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-all">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Llamar directamente</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Atención al Cliente: Lunes a viernes 09:30h - 13h (CET)</p>
            <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-700 tracking-tight">950 131 911</span>
          </a>

          <a href="mailto:info@hotelads.es" class="group p-10 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-all">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Enviar un email</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Responderé a tu consulta en menos de 24 horas laborables.</p>
            <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-blue-700 tracking-tight">info@hotelads.es</span>
          </a>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-12 text-center text-white">
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">¿Prefieres agendar una reunión?</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">Reserva un hueco directamente en mi agenda para una auditoría personalizada.</p>
          <a href="https://calendar.app.google/ouMpShqMGVHmtUJU7" target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-500 transition-all">
            Ver disponibilidad en Google Calendar
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>